      "passed": true,
      "answer": "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) is a technique where a language model is provided with relevant information retrieved from a document collection when a question is asked. Instead of relying solely on what the model memorized during training, the system first searches the documents and then asks the model to answer using the found information (rag_guide.txt).",
